flowchart TD
 O[Orchestrator agent] --> D[Discover trusted Agent Card]
 D --> V{Version + interface + auth valid?}
 V -->|No| X[Reject before sending private context]
 V -->|Yes| M[message/send with contextId]
 M --> T[Remote task store]
 T --> W[Specialist task worker]
 W --> C[Specialist-owned MCP tools]
 C --> W
 W --> A[Typed artifact store]
 W --> E[Status and artifact events]
 E --> S[SSE stream or authenticated push]
 S --> R[Orchestrator validates task/context + artifact]
 R --> P[Provenance + tenant policy + audit]
 P --> F[Delegation complete]
